id: tai-chi-expert
name: Tai Chi Expert
talentCategory: insightful
prerequisites: Tai Chi Practitioner, ToP 3+
description: >
  In the ebb and flow of battle, you ride the tides with expert prowess, transforming the enemies’ strengths into you own.
text: >
  Tai Chi Expert: In the ebb and flow of battle, you ride the tides with expert prowess, transforming the enemies’ strengths into you own.
  –Prerequisites: Tai Chi Practitioner, ToP 3+
  (1)-[Passive]: The second effect of Tai Chi Practitioner loses its 1/Round Keyword.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver that did not possess an AoE, increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 1/4 (rounded up) of that Opponent’s Might.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round, 2/Encounter]: When making a Might Clash that was initiated by an Opponent, you may use that Opponent’s Might for this Might Clash.

---

# (1) Read on Tai Chi Practitioner's file: its second effect, held with this, has no limit and its Triggered/Automatic button.

# (2) An Opponent hit by an attack with no AoE: 1/4 of their Might, rounded up, on the Wound against them - once a Round (chat.mjs,
# where the Wound is worked out against each).
[triggered/hit, 1/round, effect 2]
taiChi.wound = true;

[passive]
# (3) A Might Clash an Opponent opened: a button for you before you are ready - their Might for yours; once a Round, twice an
# Encounter (chat.mjs renderTaiChiMight).
allow taiChi.mightClash;
